{
  "name": "ondra-emotion-conflict",
  "description": "空谷 Ondra 的冲突锁（手册 §3.2）：冲突事件（否定/指责/冷暴力）进锁，建议张力 +0.15、心情压到 ≤0.35（= 六态「蔫」档下界）；锁定期间不撒娇、不主动、回复变短。两个进锁入口（事件 / 阈值 tension>0.5 或 stress>0.85），阈值那条只派生不落盘。解锁只有两条路：致歉，或连续 2 次正向信号且心情回升过 0.45 并高于进锁时。解锁后建议把张力压到 ≤0.25，否则阈值会立刻把锁扣回去。",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "types": "lib/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./src/*": "./src/*",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "lib/**/*.d.ts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "license": "AGPL-3.0",
  "ondra": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~",
    "@types/node": "22.20.1"
  }
}
